      "depth, NOT a plumbing bug -- the practical fix is architectural (e.g. encourage\n",
      "branch divergence) or accept it as a documented limitation, not a gate-mode fix.\n",
      "If Factor C is tiny for BOTH efgf1 and efgf2, that points to a genuine vanishing-\n",
      "gradient problem somewhere downstream, worth comparing against the project's\n",
      "earlier C-2b auxiliary-gradient finding.\n",
